### Home
GET http://localhost:5000/

###

### Register User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cheran",
  "email": "cheran@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login
# @name login

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cheran@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
###

### Get Users
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users

###

### Create Tournament
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Apartment Badminton Tournament",
  "sport": "Badminton",
  "date": "2026-08-01"
}

###

### Get All Tournaments
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments

###

### Get Tournament By ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments/1

###

### Update Tournament
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "State Cricket Championship"
}

###

### Delete Tournament
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

