Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Cheran",
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "email": "cheran@gmail.com",
  "dob": "2004-06-15",
  "gender": "Male",
  "profilePhoto": "profile.jpg"
}

###

### Get Player Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/player/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Update Player Profile
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/player/profile
