### Create Match

POST http://localhost:5000/api/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tournamentId": 1,
    "teamA": "Warriors",
    "teamB": "Titans",
    "venue": "Ground A",
    "matchDate": "2026-08-15",
    "matchTime": "10:00 AM"
}

### Get All Matches

GET http://localhost:5000/api/matches

### Get Match By ID

GET http://localhost:5000/api/matches/1

### Update Match

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/matches/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tournamentId": 1,
    "teamA": "Warriors",
    "teamB": "Titans",
    "venue": "Ground B",
    "matchDate": "2026-08-16",
    "matchTime": "11:00 AM",
    "status": "Completed",
    "winner": "Warriors"
}

